title: LinOTP Config Sync
agents: linotp_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Reports LinOTP's configuration sync status across cluster nodes
 (/monitoring/config) plus realm/resolver/policy counts as performance
 data.

 On a single-node installation "in sync" is trivially true; this check is
 most useful on multi-node/HA setups, where a desync indicates a
 configuration replication problem. The state used when not in sync
 defaults to WARN and is configurable via the "LinOTP config sync status"
 ruleset.

item:
 None. One "LinOTP Config Sync" service is created per configured host.

discovery:
 One "LinOTP Config Sync" service is discovered on the host running the
 special agent.
